  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Two layers, and neither is sufficient alone.** Build-time scanning covers what you make; runtime scanning covers what you *pull* — third-party images never went through your pipeline. These figures are the runtime layer: every image actually running, rescanned four times a day in rotating batches.\n\n⭐ **Read the *fixable* count, not the total.** A critical CVE with no upstream fix is a risk to accept and document; a critical CVE with a fix available is a rebuild you have not done. Only the second is actionable, and only the second belongs on a dashboard.\n\n⚠️ Measured 2026-09-22: Grype and Trivy agree on only **81%** of findings for the same Debian image, and on an Alpine image one reported 7 vulnerabilities where the other reported *Clean*. A single scanner is not coverage.\n\n*Scope: only **critical** and **high** are tracked. Medium and low on 146 running images is a number nobody acts on, and a dashboard nobody acts on trains people to ignore the ones that matter. Source: `f/probe/pod_image_cve_scan`.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Images scanned",
      "description": "Distinct images actually running and rescanned on rotation.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pod_image_cve_scan_images_total",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
