    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**DefectDojo is the record; the scanners only report into it.** The CI `scan` / `secret-scan` jobs, the runtime image scan and kube-bench all import into DefectDojo, which deduplicates, tracks each finding's life, and holds every won't-fix decision as a risk acceptance with an owner and an expiry. The panels above are the runtime scanner's own view (critical/high, per image); the ones below are DefectDojo's, across CI, runtime and secrets — click through to act. *Product type `mdapi` = what we build (CI), `mdapi-runtime` = what runs. Source: `f/security/defectdojo_metrics`, hourly; alerts: `78-defectdojo.yml`.*"
      }
    },
